--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2e0ce3e543780b04dba488492949ce28, type: 3}
  m_Name: Rigel_Day6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  lineArray:
  - speaker: 1
    text: Come to see your handiwork?
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 3
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: Your garden...
    playerEmote: 4
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Dry. My water comes off the river. The river comes off the forest. You do the math.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Ten years I asked the elders for that forest edge. For rice. Ten years they said no.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: I thought they were old fools. They said the trees hold the water for the whole valley.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 10
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Turns out they weren't fools. And you didn't ask anyone.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: I paid off a debt bigger than this village, Rigel.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: And the village is paying off yours now.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 3
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Stop planting. Let what's left of the forest stand. That's all I'm asking.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    text: I... need to think.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 1
    text: Think fast. The river won't.
    playerEmote: 0
    npcEmote: 0
    isShaking: 0
    isNpcGlaring: 0
    focusNpcSO: {fileID: 0}
  reward:
    itemDataSO: {fileID: 0}
    amount: 0
  rewardDay: 0
